      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.DomainModels.DomainModelBase<TIdentity>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.DomainModels.DomainModelBase-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base class for domain models. Uses IEntityIdentity{int} from\nthe shared interface package so domain models and entities\nshare the same identity contract.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.DomainModels.DomainModelBase-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">Domain models are NOT EF Core entities. They live on the business\nlogic side of the adapter boundary. EF Core should never see these.</p>\n"
