      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Non-generic int convenience shim over <xref href=\"Benday.EfCore.Entities.DependentEntityCollection%602\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.\nInt consumers wrap their child collections with this and keep their existing\nsyntax unchanged.</p>\n"
