      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.Entities.DependentEntityCollection<T, TIdentity>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-2.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Manages the save/delete lifecycle for a collection of child entities.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-2.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Before SaveChanges: any item with IsMarkedForDelete == true is removed\nfrom the DbSet so EF Core will delete it from the database.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-2.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">After SaveChanges: items marked for delete are pruned from the\nin-memory collection so the parent entity's navigation property\nreflects the current state.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.EntityBase-1.yml",
      "output": {
