        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.Entities.EntityBase<TIdentity>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.EntityBase-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base class for EF Core entities. Implements the shared\nIEntityIdentity and IDeleteable interfaces from Benday.Common.Interfaces.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.EntityBase-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">The identity type is generic (<code class=\"typeparamref\">TIdentity</code>) so the same\nbase class supports int, Guid, string, or any other key type. Int consumers\nuse the non-generic <xref href=\"Benday.EfCore.Entities.EntityBase\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> shim and never type <code>&lt;int&gt;</code>.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.Entities.EntityBase-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"8\">IsMarkedForDelete is [NotMapped] — it only exists in memory to signal\nthe DependentEntityCollection to remove this item during save.</p>\n"
    },
